    "steps": [
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/4/d/d/800_4d2335fbd7ea0a245b39bf8d3cfbf85d.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-1.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 1,
        "sourceStepOrder": 1,
        "pageOrder": 1,
        "adjacentText": "准备食材。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/3/5/3/800_35e6d418d61d7d6102e4c32b85546003.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-2.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg",
        "stepOrder": 2,
        "sourceStepOrder": 2,
        "pageOrder": 2,
        "adjacentText": "土豆洗净去皮切滚刀块，长茄子洗净去蒂切滚刀块，辣椒洗净去筋去籽切大片备用。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/f/4/d/800_f4e86200b3a885f42b062a334d0cd17d.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-3.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 3,
        "sourceStepOrder": 3,
        "pageOrder": 3,
        "adjacentText": "蒜去皮去蒂切蒜末备用。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/9/4/b/800_9412ea75b89494d67ce9a3acfa3577fb.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-4.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 4,
        "sourceStepOrder": 4,
        "pageOrder": 4,
        "adjacentText": "切好的茄子放进容器中，均匀撒1勺红薯淀粉，颠匀，让每一块茄子裹薄薄一层淀粉，既吸油又更容易挂汁。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/0/5/d/800_05ae16b393bc5498955e38263a09d4bd.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-5.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 5,
        "sourceStepOrder": 5,
        "pageOrder": 5,
        "adjacentText": "小碗中加2勺生抽，1勺蚝油，加1中勺白糖、1小勺盐、1勺玉米淀粉，半碗清水搅拌均匀成料汁。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/9/f/5/800_9f56899ddacfbcffd51f78c91b2a31c5.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-6.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 6,
        "sourceStepOrder": 6,
        "pageOrder": 6,
        "adjacentText": "锅中加入2勺食用油，烧至7成热，将土豆块下锅。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/7/5/f/800_75b8cad0641fa7f65a7e10c324027a1f.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-7.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 7,
        "sourceStepOrder": 7,
        "pageOrder": 7,
        "adjacentText": "中小火煎到表面金黄、基本熟透后盛出备用。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/4/2/5/800_42cb2309df54ef42e0a150423170bc35.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-8.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 8,
        "sourceStepOrder": 8,
        "pageOrder": 8,
        "adjacentText": "锅中再补2勺食用油，烧热后放入茄子块。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/e/4/2/800_e4cb75af13455ecbba1070b88fb34372.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-9.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 9,
        "sourceStepOrder": 9,
        "pageOrder": 9,
        "adjacentText": "再下辣椒，煎到茄子变软，辣椒微焦，快速翻两下，先盛出备用。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/8/8/2/800_88ad5247700b33edf8dfcbd1cca87542.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-10.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 10,
        "sourceStepOrder": 10,
        "pageOrder": 10,
        "adjacentText": "锅中再加入1勺食用油，下入一半的蒜末炒香。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/d/7/2/800_d73ba164f2e1235187067a1061a36982.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-11.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 11,
        "sourceStepOrder": 11,
        "pageOrder": 11,
        "adjacentText": "倒入提前调好的酱汁，小火煮到微微变稠。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/7/2/5/800_72bb739e5db652f92d168efc30ae0925.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-12.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg",
        "stepOrder": 12,
        "sourceStepOrder": 12,
        "pageOrder": 12,
        "adjacentText": "倒回土豆、茄子和青椒，再加入剩下一半的蒜末。"
      },
      {
        "originalUrl": "https://cp1.douguo.com/upload/caiku/0/a/a/800_0ab6838ea80607c82f8d10a53394ce2a.jpg",
        "repositoryPath": "assets/dishes/sources/cn-010-di-san-xian/step-13.jpg",
        "httpStatus": 200,
        "contentType": "image/jpeg;charset=UTF-8",
        "stepOrder": 13,
        "sourceStepOrder": 13,
        "pageOrder": 13,
        "adjacentText": "大火快速翻炒，让酱汁均匀裹住食材，收至明亮油润即可出锅。"
      }
    ]
  },
